@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### List all users (admin only)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token -> 401
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users

### With an invalid token -> 401
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token

### One user
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### User statistics
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate / deactivate a user (admin only)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/users/update-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "targetID": 2, "newStatus": true }

### Reset another user's password (admin only)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/users/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "targetID": 2, "newPassword": "Temp123!" }
